# the forced arms of darksamus_fsm2_force2.py: MissileDeflect with and without a shot in flight
# (first: after the HeavyHit / PhazonSuck block the shot no longer reaches the near list), HeavyHit
# activations (each followed by an Interrupt), PhazonSuck entered from a non-taunt state, the
# phazon path states, and GetUp / Patrol run with statecall (no FSM2 node has them).
@f600 send u04f7 Activate
@f650 objs AIHint
@f1900 shoot u04f7 20; fsm u04f7 MissileDeflect
@f2000 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f2100 fsm u04f7 MissileDeflect
@f2112 shoot u04f7 20
@f2200 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f2300 fsm u04f7 MissileDeflect
@f2312 shoot u04f7 20
@f2400 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f2600 fsm u04f7 HeavyHit
@f2660 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f2700 fsm u04f7 HeavyHit
@f2760 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f2800 fsm u04f7 HeavyHit
@f2860 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f2900 fsm u04f7 HeavyHit
@f2960 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f3000 fsm u04f7 HeavyHit
@f3060 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f3100 fsm u04f7 HeavyHit
@f3160 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f3200 fsm u04f7 HeavyHit
@f3260 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f3300 fsm u04f7 PhazonSuck
@f3400 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f3450 fsm u04f7 PhazonSuck
@f3550 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f3600 fsm u04f7 PhazonSuck
@f3700 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f3800 fsm u04f7 GoToPhazonAttack
@f3900 fsm u04f7 GoToPhazonEnrage
@f4000 fsm u04f7 PhazonRise
@f4100 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f4150 fsm u04f7 PhazonRise
@f4250 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f4400 statecall u04f7 GetUp 0; statecall u04f7 GetUp 1
@f4408 statecall u04f7 GetUp 1
@f4416 statecall u04f7 GetUp 2
@f4500 statecall u04f7 Patrol 0
@f4504 statecall u04f7 Patrol 1
@f4508 place u04f7 player 0; statecall u04f7 Patrol 1
@f4512 statecall u04f7 Patrol 2
@f4520 fsm u04f7 Interrupt
@f4700 objs dark
